    "body": "### Contact Details (e.g. Tox ID or email)\n\n_No response_\n\n### qTox Version\n\nv1.18.3\n\n### Commit Hash\n\nb7802b4\n\n### Toxcore Version\n\nv0.2.21\n\n### Qt Version\n\n6.9.3\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Start qTox\n\n\n### Observed Behavior\n\nThe main error is: The dmg installs the app but I can't open it. Also I can't compile the app by my self because there are not a Brewfile, required to compile.\n\n<img width=\"253\" height=\"262\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/90d96968-015e-4daa-a689-d85322a579c8\" />\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\nThe app opening.\n\n### Reproducibility\n\nAlways\n\n### Operating System\n\nmacOS\n\n### Operating System version/distro/name/etc.\n\nMacOS 26.0.1 (macOS Tahoe)\n\n### Relevant log output\n\n```shell\n\n```",
