            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Depending on how you download qtox, it is marked as untrusted/quarantined.\n\nYou can fix that by running `xattr -drs com.apple.quarantine /Applications/qtox.app`\n\nOr use other means of downloading it.",
